  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "LINOONE always runs full speed and only\nin straight lines. If facing an obstacle,\nit makes a right-angle turn to evade it.\fThis POKéMON is very challenged by\ngently curving roads.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When hunting, LINOONE will make a\nbeeline straight for the prey at a full\nrun. While this POKéMON is capable of\ftopping 60 mph, it has to come to a\nscreeching halt before it can turn.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is exceedingly fast if it only has to run\nin a straight line. When it spots pond-\ndwelling prey underwater, it quickly leaps\nin and catches it with its sharp claws.",
